<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2609_10125.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig dienst, und
<lb n="2"/>was wir ehren liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> ver-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, zuvor. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Frome</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">edle</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrnveste</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weise</unclear>, insonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> herren und
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denselben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künden</unclear> wir, in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">her</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebrachtem</unclear> nachbarlichem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verthrauen</unclear>,
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unverhalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> lassen: was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">massen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herzogen</unclear> in <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-132" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bayern</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. ain solche
<lb n="9"/>merckliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzahl</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dreyen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>jaren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hero</unclear> allhie, wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> willen
<lb n="11"/>und befelch, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gering</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hältig</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>gemachter halber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bazen</unclear> (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">doch</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> gleichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> Reich noch wol zu
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">finden</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zusamen</unclear> gebracht, und, ver-
<lb n="15"/>mög <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mündlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichts</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">per</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">siben</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>Ring <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pfening</unclear> eingewechselt, uns aber
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">per</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">8</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. oder 2. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kreuzer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aufrechnen</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/>und alle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-135" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Augspurg</unclear></placeName> wider umb
<lb n="19"/>münzen lassen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlust</unclear> und abgang <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uber</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwain</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/>zig tausent <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gulden</unclear> erstrecken thuet.
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Die</unclear> Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sehe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wochen</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezalt</unclear> haben, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitel</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> nit
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">manglen</unclear>, an die hand nemen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>,
<lb n="25"/>die unß noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwerlicher</unclear> fallen werden;
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2609_10126.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> wir aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landts</unclear> ainich gelt
